          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökikutïlil kegh tïsï cho kimi otini kilïtuno wölay tïlil amarïpnye wölo kilata tötutkökwa cho pö ighisyewut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngetyö tumï löwïr cho pö pipö Lawi, choni kï ompö Asap, Eman, Yedutun nko monekwa cho le wor nko werkökwa cho tupchö. Kipura kegh sïro pö katani cho karamach, kighyongo okumpö kongasis nyo pö ato kïpelo amöros kïmi nko tïsï cho le 120 cho kikutöy kontin, kitïng chane karïn cho töpölöl cho kilïwöy kusilyö nko pïkantis nko kurerun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
